## 11. Escalation

| Situation | Route |
|---|---|
| Work needs a ruling | `HQ` |
| Issue already claimed / routing conflict | `Triage` |
| A tool misbehaves, or a binding's instrument is inadequate | the **owner of that tool or substrate**, named in the binding — dispatched in the same turn it is found, never left as a note in a report |
| The law itself is wrong or stale | `HQ` (authorship of the law is not a worker's call) |
| Human decision required | the operator, in the chat — with the options stated |

